        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"117cc256-0c7b-49e5-8117-f58f08080682\",\"review_text\":\"Disappointed....Seriously?! Premium for repeating songs too now?! Would they now even charge premium for just logging in too?! This is absurd like if you can't even repeat a song,shuffle a playlist or rewind a song it's just a force to listen music...Youtube Music is better\"},{\"review_id\":\"daaa304e-42a0-42f5-809e-e99936079030\",\"review_text\":\"Its from Sweden and they burnt our holy book Quran.We cant tolerate it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"28d56033-ab12-4e6a-b611-1ba91a2d8dca\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad all basic features are premium now What is next to ask for premium for playing the song and opening the Spotify app\"},{\"review_id\":\"7a1760f6-e08d-458f-942f-067e7c01bd30\",\"review_text\":\"Lyrics translation needed.. and all lyrics need to English\"},{\"review_id\":\"fefd9bd7-ada0-4fb6-b837-dde8cc4c5844\",\"review_text\":\"It been months tha this is not working right.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e3311fd0-e9dd-4c09-9f04-90c09b617dbb\",\"review_text\":\"Not Download This App Sweden You Allow That This I Can Do That Thing You Never Seen🤬\"},{\"review_id\":\"f2011e93-cdd4-4c69-9b22-a25bcc6a89bb\",\"review_text\":\"Good at removing features. Bad at fixing bugs\"},{\"review_id\":\"9324b334-2ec7-44ec-9da4-5b9f7614b689\",\"review_text\":\"Never works as desired on smart speakers.\"},{\"review_id\":\"324b26d7-651e-4e09-a7a4-bcf66650e722\",\"review_text\":\"Nice 👍 ഹലോ നൈസ്\"},{\"review_id\":\"bd12a9d8-32e1-4a3b-af87-3bcbd0ae070e\",\"review_text\":\"🛐\"}]}"
